{"kit":1,"name":"test","title":"ห้องทดสอบระบบถ้ำ","about":"The kit's test room: every piece the kit knows, once, to try it on (not a room of the game). A hall with the way in; a round well 10.5 m deep beside it with a built stair winding a turn and a half down round it, over itself; a built bridge across the well to an alcove; under the hall a tunnel from the well's floor to a lower chamber; a nook drawn as a picture; pillars, lamps. Its land: floors that roll and rise into the walls' feet; in the hall two tiers of ledges with a slope up to the first, a mound, a hollow, two boulders; in the lower chamber a drawn picture of heights; two mouths (the way in, the way on). Its ground: the room's by rule the caves' own (moss in the light, gravel at the feet of faces, sand by the water), the drawn nook's a ruin's (old paving, broken), the lower chamber's a grove's (turf under its lamp, moss, leaves in the dim); by hand two earth ways, a gravel way to the lower mouth, turf on the first ledge's top and, from a drawn picture, on the mound, leaves in an outline round the west boulder, a round of bare stone between the pillars. Its grass: green, growing by itself wherever turf lies (under the strong lamps, on the ledge, on the mound, in the grove chamber, with the earth way through it). (made by tools/make-cave-room.py from tools/cave-rooms/test.json; read by cave-room.js)","bin":{"mesh":{"vertices":28962,"indices":169308,"pos":0,"nrm":347544,"light":463392,"info":579240,"idx":695088},"floor":{"nx":119,"nz":96,"x0":-1,"z0":-1,"cell":0.4,"layers":4,"floor":1372320,"ceil":1463712,"paint":1555104,"paint2":1737888,"kinds":[{"name":"gravel","picture":"cave-gravel-paint.webp","tile":2.4,"tint":[1.0,1.02,1.1],"ragged":0.3,"step":"earth","mean":[0.3737,0.3798,0.398],"at":0},{"name":"paving","picture":"boss-slabs-paint.webp","tile":2.38,"tint":"built","grey":0.187,"ragged":0.12,"step":"stone","mean":[0.1657,0.1871,0.2358],"at":1},{"name":"leaves","picture":"forest-damp-paint.webp","tile